  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/08/P1650950.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>Marc Montoliu Pallar&eacute;s ha llegit el preg&oacute; de les festes d&#39;agost a Suera, que duraran fins diumenge 20, en pres&egrave;ncia de l&#39;alcalde, Jos&eacute; Mart&iacute; Garcia, la reina, Alba Lengua Garcia, i la reina infantil, Carlota Quiroga Mar&iacute;n, acompanyada per Enric Garcia Mar&iacute;n, a les quals s&#39;ha recollit abans en cercavila. Tamb&eacute; ha intervingut Enrique Salvador Sancho, en nom de la comissi&oacute; de festes.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdivendresfestessueraagost17/p1650858.jpg\" alt=\"p1650858\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdivendresfestessueraagost17/p1650859.jpg\" alt=\"p1650859\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdivendresfestessueraagost17/p1650860.jpg\" alt=\"p1650860\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdivendresfestessueraagost17/p1650861.jpg\" alt=\"p1650861\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdivendresfestessueraagost17/p1650862.jpg\" alt=\"p1650862\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdivendresfestessueraagost17/p1650863.jpg\" alt=\"p1650863\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdivendresfestessueraagost17/p1650864.jpg\" alt=\"p1650864\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerdivendresfestessueraagost17/p16508